                "text": "An analysis of the training examples reveals the following transformation rule:\n1. Identify all 4-connected components of color 5.\n2. Group components by their size (pixel count).\n3. Components that appear as a pair of the same size are recolored based on size:\n   - Size 4 (largest paired size) $\\rightarrow$ color 1 (blue)\n   - Size 3 $\\rightarrow$ color 2 (red)\n   - Size 2 $\\rightarrow$ color 3 (green)\n   (Equivalently, paired components of size $s \\in \\{2, 3, 4\\}$ receive color $5 - s$).\n4. Any components with a unique size (occurring only once) remain unchanged (color 5).\n\nPlease provide the test input grid!",
